<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova's discount rate steady at 18 pct per annum.</title>
<headline>Moldova's discount rate steady at 18 pct per annum.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's National Bank official discount</p>
<p>rate remained steady at 18 percent annual since July 21, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>The rate was set at a credit funds auction on Monday, where 10 banks acquired a total of 4.0 million lei ($0.88 million) of the National Bank's reserves for a three-month term.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
